<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Privacy Policy · Socio</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script>
    (function () {
      var saved = null;
      try { saved = localStorage.getItem('socio-theme'); } catch (e) {}
      if (saved === 'dark' || (!saved && window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches)) {
        document.documentElement.classList.add('dark');
      }
    })();
    window.toggleTheme = function () {
      var el = document.documentElement;
      var dark = el.classList.toggle('dark');
      try { localStorage.setItem('socio-theme', dark ? 'dark' : 'light'); } catch (e) {}
    };
  </script>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            bg: 'rgb(var(--bg) / <alpha-value>)',
            surface: 'rgb(var(--surface) / <alpha-value>)',
            'surface-2': 'rgb(var(--surface-2) / <alpha-value>)',
            input: 'rgb(var(--input) / <alpha-value>)',
            border: 'rgb(var(--border) / <alpha-value>)',
            text: 'rgb(var(--text) / <alpha-value>)',
            muted: 'rgb(var(--muted) / <alpha-value>)',
            faint: 'rgb(var(--faint) / <alpha-value>)',
            accent: 'rgb(var(--accent) / <alpha-value>)',
            'accent-fg': 'rgb(var(--accent-fg) / <alpha-value>)',
            ok: { bg: 'rgb(var(--ok-bg) / <alpha-value>)', fg: 'rgb(var(--ok-fg) / <alpha-value>)' },
            warn: { bg: 'rgb(var(--warn-bg) / <alpha-value>)', fg: 'rgb(var(--warn-fg) / <alpha-value>)' },
            err: { bg: 'rgb(var(--err-bg) / <alpha-value>)', fg: 'rgb(var(--err-fg) / <alpha-value>)' },
            info: { bg: 'rgb(var(--info-bg) / <alpha-value>)', fg: 'rgb(var(--info-fg) / <alpha-value>)' }
          }
        }
      }
    };
  </script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/theme.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-bg text-text min-h-screen flex flex-col">
  <header class="border-b border-border bg-bg/80 backdrop-blur">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <a href="/" class="font-display font-bold text-xl tracking-tight">socio<span class="text-faint">.dev</span></a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <button type="button" onclick="toggleTheme()" aria-label="Toggle dark mode" title="Toggle dark mode" class="icon-btn">
          <svg class="theme-icon-sun w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/>
            <path stroke-linecap="round" d="M12 2v2m0 16v2M4.9 4.9l1.4 1.4m11.4 11.4 1.4 1.4M2 12h2m16 0h2M4.9 19.1l1.4-1.4m11.4-11.4 1.4-1.4"/>
          </svg>
          <svg class="theme-icon-moon w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 12.8A9 9 0 1 1 11.2 3a7 7 0 0 0 9.8 9.8z"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
        <a href="/login" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Sign in</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="flex-1 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-14 w-full">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="micro mb-10">Last updated: 2026-08-11</p>

    <div class="space-y-10 text-[15px] text-muted leading-7">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-text text-lg tracking-tight mb-2">1. What we store</h2>
        <p>To operate the Service we store: your username and a password hash, platform connection tokens (used to publish on your behalf), and the posts and media you schedule. All data is stored in a local SQLite database on the server that runs the Service.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-text text-lg tracking-tight mb-2">2. Passwords</h2>
        <p>Passwords are stored as salted, key-stretched hashes (scrypt). They are never stored in plain text and can never be recovered; a new password must be set by the operator if forgotten.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-text text-lg tracking-tight mb-2">3. Sessions</h2>
        <p>Login uses a signed, HTTP-only cookie. It expires after 30 days. We do not use third-party tracking cookies.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-text text-lg tracking-tight mb-2">4. Third-party platforms</h2>
        <p>When you connect an account (LinkedIn, Meta, Google, TikTok), the connection is made with that provider's authorization flow and their terms apply. The Service publishes content through their APIs using the tokens you authorize. Each provider's privacy policy governs data they collect during those flows.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-text text-lg tracking-tight mb-2">5. Media and content</h2>
        <p>Media you upload for scheduling is stored on the server and only exposed through authenticated endpoints. It is never shared with third parties except the platform you explicitly select as a posting target.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-text text-lg tracking-tight mb-2">6. Deletion</h2>
        <p>Request removal of your account from the operator and your account, tokens, and scheduled content will be deleted from the database.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-text text-lg tracking-tight mb-2">7. Changes</h2>
        <p>This policy may be updated from time to time. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-border py-5 text-center text-xs text-faint">
    socio · <a href="/terms" class="link">Terms of Service</a> · <a href="/privacy" class="link">Privacy Policy</a>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
